RASPADRIVE
==========

This is the firmware update / doc update portal for Raspadrive.

For deep dive: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oc3YlvDmcVM
For overview: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mfd3JA38tkY

For UK sales, visit: https://zxmicrojack.co.uk 
For EU sales, visit: https://antoniovillena.com

Updating the Firmware
---------------------

Firmware can be updated by placing the release binary (called RASPADRV.UPD) onto the root
directory of a USB disk formatted with FAT32, inserting into the USB1.1 slot, powering up the
spectrum, holding the M key to invoke the Raspadrive menu, and select Firmware Update.

Contents of the ZIP
-------------------

- firmware - directory containing:
	- raspadrv.uf2 for disaster recovery - connecting USB-A to USB-A of a PC laptop and 
	  holding the bootsel button.
	  *PLEASE DISCONNECT FROM SPECTRUM FOR THIS*

	- RASPADRV.UPD for update via USB - see above for instructions

- sdcard - containing skeleton for SD/MMC memory card, formatted to FAT32 only.

- changelog.txt - history of Raspadrive versions

- manual.pdf - The manual describing its use along with a quickstart guide.



